; appending in either order gives the same length: len(L1++L2) = len(L2++L1)
; len(L1++L2) = lenL1+lenL2 [len-append] = lenL2+lenL1 [+ commutative] = len(L2++L1) [len-append, reversed]. A symmetry corollary; no induction (composes two banked lemmas).
